meta {
  name: Fleet savings summary
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/recommendations/openshift/savings-summary?engine=cost
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Fleet rollup: by_plugin includes container, node, pvc, snapshot, vm (gpu=0).
  VM totals need ROS_SAVINGS_ESTIMATES_ENABLED and KOKU_MASU_URL at ingestion.

  Negative savings are valid: when current usage is already below the recommended target,
  estimated_monthly_savings.value can be negative (additional monthly cost for headroom).
  Positive values are standard savings opportunities.
}
